ATP fixture for VMC-ATP-032. Test instrumentation, not part of the product.

Adds /atpstall, which blocks the game thread for 6 seconds. The default stall threshold
is 2 seconds at 20 TPS, so /health reports "stalled" during the stall and "ok" after it.
The server log gets "ATP stall start" and "ATP stall end".

Apply at the repository root:   git apply tools/atp/patches/<this file>
Remove it after the test:       git apply -R tools/atp/patches/<this file>

